B.GI=s(["Spring Boot microservices for billing, settlement, patients, medical records, products / medical acts and fees.","Mobile payments (Wave, Orange Money) and insurance / third-party payer flows (ICAMO, Eyassur, Passport).","FHIR R4 interoperability API (YONEWI) integrated with OpenIMIS, with Elasticsearch indexing and Redis cache.","Event-driven data migration platform (T\xe9l\xe9migration) between SIMedical, Eyassur and Passport over Kafka.","Contribution to EYONE Framework, shared Spring Boot starters (Kafka, Elasticsearch, Redis, MinIO, WebClient, JOLT, security).","Frontend features on the Angular application and CI/CD with Jenkins, Bitbucket Pipelines and Docker."],t.s)
