B.Ds=new A.j0("November 2025 \u2013 Present","Backend Java / Fullstack Developer","EYONE SANT\xc9","Design and development of the SI M\xe9dical platform (hospital information system) and of health-data interoperability services, in a microservices architecture.",B.GI,B.fD,B.FG)
B.G_=s(["Level 3 maintenance and technical support, incident resolution and production debugging.","Design and exposure of APIs for Orange B2C/B2B applications (Orange Money, Maxit, Orange & Moi, Kaabu\u2026), internal applications (HR SelfCare) and partner systems.","Collaboration with software architects to implement new interfaces.","Unit, integration and regression tests, applying API development best practices.","Agile/Scrum and SAFe, with strong involvement in continuous delivery.","Distributed architectures: Kafka (streaming), Elastic & ELK (data historisation, monitoring and log analysis)."],t.s)
B.G7=s(["Designed and developed RESTful APIs for document search, upload and download.","Implemented a secure microservices architecture with Spring Boot and Spring Cloud.","Integrated Keycloak for authentication and authorization.","Documented and tested APIs with Postman and exposed them through Apigee.","CI/CD with Jenkins and OpenShift; sprint planning in Jira, source code on Bitbucket."],t.s)
B.Gr=s(["Centralized document databases previously spread across multiple systems.","Simplified integration with other systems through standardized, secure APIs.","Improved document traceability and governance across departments."],t.s)
B.DQ=new A.n6("Docubase \u2013 Document Management and Indexing System","2023","A centralized system unifying the document databases of the Orange ecosystem. Each information system previously managed its own repository; the goal was a single platform for document access and management (upload, download, search), improving data consistency and operational efficiency.",B.G7,"JHipster \xb7 Spring Boot \xb7 Spring Cloud \xb7 Java 11 \xb7 Keycloak \xb7 Apigee \xb7 Postman \xb7 Jenkins \xb7 OpenShift \xb7 Jira \xb7 Bitbucket",B.Gr)
B.GG=s(["Designed and developed the microservice for P2P transfers, international remittances, cancellations and package-based fees.","Redesigned the billing module, unifying internal and partner billing in one microservice.","Redis caching for high-volume transactional data; Elasticsearch for search, monitoring and analytics.","Keycloak security, APIs exposed through Apigee and documented with Swagger, Redoc and Postman."],t.s)
B.HG=s(["Dynamic package-based pricing model live for Orange Money users.","Partner billing and transaction logic centralized in a single microservice.","Stronger security and transactional integrity through fine-grained access control."],t.s)
B.DR=new A.n6("Orange Money Package \u2013 Wallet Transfer and Billing Redesign","2024 \u2013 2025","Modernisation of the Mobile Money ecosystem by redesigning wallet transfers and billing. Key feature: transaction packages. For example, a 75 XOF package allows up to 10,000 XOF of fee-free transfers; on a 15,000 XOF transfer, the first 10,000 XOF stay free and standard fees apply to the remaining 5,000 XOF.",B.GG,"Java 21 \xb7 Spring Boot \xb7 Spring Cloud \xb7 JHipster \xb7 Redis \xb7 Elasticsearch \xb7 Keycloak \xb7 Apigee \xb7 Swagger \xb7 Maven",B.HG)
B.HT=s(["Designed and developed backend APIs for the full credit request and validation workflow.","Integrated authorization and customer consent flows in the Orange Money ecosystem.","Worked with architects and security teams on banking and regulatory compliance.","Unit, integration and regression tests; CI/CD and monitoring on OpenShift."],t.s)
B.Gl=s(["Loan processing time cut from several hours to a few seconds.","Fully automated workflow: scoring, authorization, consent, validation.","Credit access for unbanked and underbanked users."],t.s)
B.DP=new A.n6("Orange Bank \u2013 Tik Tak (Mobile Credit Service)","2024 \u2013 2025","Instant mobile credit for eligible Orange Money customers based on their financial scoring, requested and received directly from the wallet. APIs cover the full credit lifecycle: loan request, partner bank authorization, customer consent, validation and disbursement.",B.HT,"Java 21 \xb7 Spring Boot \xb7 Spring Cloud \xb7 JHipster \xb7 Keycloak \xb7 Apigee \xb7 Redis \xb7 Elasticsearch \xb7 Maven",B.Gl)
